 HER 2 c erbB 2  See note  Note  These tests were developed and their performance characteristics determined by the Pathology Department at the Massachusetts General Hospital  They have not been cleared or approved by the U S  Food and Drug Administration  FDA   The FDA has determined that such clearance or approval is not necessary  this laboratory has established and verified the test s accuracy and precision  Added by  Atul Kumar Bhan  M D  Signed On  25 REMOVED_MONTH 04 at 12 47     HER 2 Addendum     RESULTS OF FLUORESCENCE IN SITU HYBRIDIZATION  FISH  FOR HER 2 NEU GENE AMPLIFICATION Breast  Right  block B   HER 2 neu gene in tumor cells  REMOVED_DATE  Not Amplified   See note  Note  Results are expressed as the average ratio of HER 2 signals  222  to chromosome 17 signals  176  in 60 tumor cell nuclei  A ratio of greater than REMOVED_DATE or equal to REMOVED_DATE indicates HER 2 neu gene amplification adjusted for chromosome 17 polysomy using PathVysion by Vysis  Added by  Atul Kumar Bhan  M D  Signed On  19 REMOVED_MONTH 04 at 13 04 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right breast   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 5cm simple mastectomy specimen with a suture at the 12 o clock stitch margin  There is an attached REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 0cm axillary tail  and a REMOVED_DATE x 11 0cm tan pink unremarkable overlying skin ellipse  The nipple areola complex measures REMOVED_DATE x 3 0cm and is unremarkable  No scar is identified  The anterior aspect is inked blue and the posterior black  Sectioning reveals a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm tan pink  indurated  ill defined mass located within the mid portion of the specimen  The mass comes to 2 0cm to the skin surface  2 5cm to the anterior margin and 2 5cm to the posterior margin  The uninvolved parenchyma is tan pink to yellow and lobulated  containing a few blue dome cysts  No discrete mass or lesions are identified  Within the axilla are multiple lymph nodes ranging from 0 5cm to 4 2cm in greatest dimension  Representative sections are submitted as follows  A  Posterior margin taken en face  B D  Sections of mass  E  Section of uninvolved parenchyma  F  Six whole lymph nodes  G  Five whole lymph nodes  H  Six whole lymph nodes  I  Four whole lymph nodes  J  Five whole lymph nodes  K  Three whole lymph nodes  L  Three whole lymph nodes  M O  One trisected lymph node  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  right sentinel node   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm fragment of adipose tissue  One REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm lymph node is identified  bisected  and submitted as frozen section  1  now as P  Gross Description by  Jael A  Colque Resident  SHABIN NANJI  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1  LYMPH NODE  SENTINEL  METASTATIC CARCINOMA  O R  Resident  RANIA M  SELIEM  MD O R  Diagnosis by  GREGORY LAUWERS  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  PART A  LYMPH NODE  RIGHT SENTINEL   EXCISION PART B  BREAST RIGHT  SIMPLE MASTECTOMY , No.
