perior and inferior edges  Transverse sections are done in the center of the specimen  revealing an ill defined area of white  fibrous tissue  containing at its center small cavities spanning 2cm  The cavities are located 0 4cm from the anterior margin and more than 1cm from the posterior  lateral and medial margins  SECTION CODE L N  Transverse sections  medial aspect  superior to inferior  O Q  Transverse sections  lateral  superior to inferior  R U  Superior margin  vertical section   medial half  V X  Superior margin  vertical section   lateral half  Y Z  Inferior margin  vertical section   medial half  AA BB  Inferior margin  vertical section   lateral half  Resident  LAURENCE DE LEVAL  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART A  BREAST  LEFT   RE EXCISION PART B  BREAST  RIGHT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY , Not_reported.
