of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  15 REMOVED_MONTH 97 at 11 57    REVISED REMOVED_DATE        RECEPTOR IMMUNOHISTOCHEMISTRY Addendum     THIS ADDENDUM HAS BEEN DELETED FOR THIS REPORT GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right breast  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm  tan pink  firm mass  The specimen is inked and sectioned to reveal a tan  firm nodule  grossly abutting the margin  A representative section is frozen as FX  1 and resubmitted in cassette A  The remainder of the tissue is entirely submitted in B through E  A portion of the tissue is saved for research  Resident  ERIN OCHOA  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1   RIGHT BREAST NODULE   INFILTRATING DUCTAL CARCINOMA  O R  Resident  HOWARD CHANG  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Gunnlaugur P  Nielsen  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Edwin Lee Carter  M D  PART   RIGHT BREAST  EXCISIONAL BIOPSY   report_end  , No.
