er quadrant with the deep margin The axillary tail contains 16 lymph nodes varying from REMOVED_DATE to 2 0cm  The lymph nodes are submitted in cassettes K N  Also received in the same container are multiple fragments of cutaneous and subcutaneous tissue with no gross abnormalities aggregating to REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 0cm  representative sections are submitted in O P  Resident  SELIM NASSER  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  PART   BREAST  RIGHT   MODIFIED RADICAL MASTECTOMY   report_end  , No.
